                                Optional.ofNullable(doWhileTaskModel.getWorkflowTask())
                                        .map(WorkflowTask::getLoopCondition)
                                        .orElse(null),
                                e.getMessage());
                LOGGER.error(message);
                return markTaskFailure(
                        doWhileTaskModel, TaskModel.Status.FAILED_WITH_TERMINAL_ERROR, message);
            }
